ie & The Banshees\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/OElhMc1KxNJswe6R0etyiqH9pH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Career-spanning retrospective of Siouxsie & The Banshees' video output\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860278,\"title\":\"Stephen Curry: Underrated\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mFpnGiDrY9Brz4FQLKBKX1uCbl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kffxjVKaxjFM6utstRUFKbB8DZk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The remarkable coming-of-age story of Stephen Curry—one of the most influential, dynamic, and unexpected players in basketball history—and his rise from an undersized college player to a four-time NBA champion.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860578,\"title\":\"Jackie Chan: Building an Icon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSSGZLWKWt4RAf68mMgjUMfZIRw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tyPojL6AL8mdVlpwvVvO5SJFyTJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jackie Chan is a true icon of Asian and Chinese culture. Over a 45-year-long career, he has carved a niche for himself as an actor, stuntman, director, and screenwriter, but also singer and formidable businessman. After starring in almost 200 films, Jackie Chan has reconciled fans of genre film and Hollywood blockbusters, whilst bridging the gap between Asian and Western cinema.  Through film excerpts, archive footage and images, and an offbeat approach inspired by the visual codes of the golden age of kung fu films, this documentary will take a look back at the creation of a popular hero who has come to be an icon for China, and for the entire Asian continent.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":28371,\"title\":\"Nirvana: With the Lights Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AlPvclTasX1uBmceCczyE6zZB9Z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kuxIblYPPkbfYFPZspAI0oK3n3t.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Highlighted on the With The Lights Out DVD is a previously unreleased video of nine songs performed in 1988 at bassist Krist Novoselic's mother's house in Aberdeen, Washington; the rare \\\"In Bloom\\\" Sub Pop music video, and 10 never-before-seen live performances. Noteworthy among them are debut renditions of \\\"Pennyroyal Tea\\\", \\\"Smells Like Teen Spirit\\\" both from early 1991. Also premiering is an unlikely performance of Jacques Brel and Rod McKuen's \\\"Seasons In The Sun\\\" shot at a Rio de Janeiro studio.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":651714,\"title\":\"Dio: The Singles Collection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yjEI4OnKX2m7OCbvzPjPTvuteIq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l9ZViNrXfzaE1RR6Q2g7CQbQsGB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A collection of conceptual videos that defined the legendary career of Ronnie James Dio and Dio.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":276563,\"title\":\"Barbra Streisand: Becoming an Icon 1942–1984\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bArqnFqlzJPMJqNvcRuLkLTjd2e.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dvg7k4Yc4Bk8usvMN2NaNoQQIF8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Barbra Streisand grew up in working class Brooklyn, dreaming of escape from her tough childhood. A stellar student, she resisted the pressure to go to college as her sights were firmly set on Broadway. She was determined to become an actress and landed her first role aged 16, but it was two years later, when she started to sing, that her career took off.  Subverting stereotypes and breaking glass ceilings, this programme looks at her rise to stardom and the remarkable achievements of her early career.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270698,\"title\":\"I'm a Porn Star\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p5sRhu92BxooLfjYCl56MR1zWWN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uWW6bLyvXt7TpHe6VYRneFficI7.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"I'm a Porn Star follows the lives of guys in the neighborhood who are likely a lot more famous than you - at least on the Internet. There are an estimated 370 million pornographic websites on-line. Porn is now a thirteen BILLION dollar business. So who's doing all this moonlighting? Turns out -- probably some people you know.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475930,\"title\":\"Knife+Heart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Aodlp3TH6FBti9igUCt8f5KS7Nb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o6rSSDdXkQRGCYKTkwiFjWG7qov.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the summer of 1979, gay porn producer Anne sets out to film her most ambitious film yet, but her actors are picked off, one by one, by a mysterious killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645907,\"title\":\"Tips\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a57V6cQr4oL0OKoNWOAjZCzxlQe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mario (Thiago Cazado) is in debt. To pay the bills, he displays the body on a famous porn site.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"6MRV07extzU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"TVYQ3OgwZ2U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"e_E9W2vsRbQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}